<title>ITALY: Italian Treasury cancels 4.5 bln lire public debt.</title>
<headline>Italian Treasury cancels 4.5 bln lire public debt.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy cancelled 4.5 billion lire of public debt as of October 1, using funds from a special debt reduction fund, the Official Gazette said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said the Treasury bought back 4.5 billion lire of three-year Btps which expired on October 1.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom 00 392 66129450</p>
</text>
